## Scope: the code, not the person

The MIT licence above covers the **source code** of this repository.

It does **not** cover the personal content the repository happens to contain, all rights to which
are reserved:

- Personal photographs, including the images under `frontend/src/assets/images/`
- Biographical and written content — the About and Experience copy, and any text describing
  Alex Cash's history, employment, education, or opinions
- The résumé (`frontend/src/assets/AlexResume.pdf`) and its contents
- The "AC" monogram and any other personal branding or identity marks

You are welcome to read, fork, learn from, and reuse the code. Please do not republish the personal
content, and do not present this site, its branding, or its biography as your own.
